      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182981\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182981\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Materials used as a base for wall tile in tub and shower areas and wall and ceiling panels in shower areas shall be of materials listed in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-182980', hash: '#JD_BCTable2509.2' }}\">Table 2509.2<\/Link> and installed in accordance with the manufacturer's recommendations. Water-resistant gypsum backing board shall be used as a base for tile in water closet compartment walls when installed in accordance with GA-216 or ASTM C 840 and the manufacturer's recommendations. Regular gypsum wallboard is permitted under tile or wall panels in other wall and ceiling areas when installed in accordance with GA-216 or ASTM C 840.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182982\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182982\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable2509.2\" id=\"JD_BCTable2509.2\" title=\"BC Table 2509.2\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 2509.2<br><\/br>Backerboard Materials<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182983\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182983\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "5190-html-1",
